list.item:
Calls upon the parties to comply with all
                            his decisions and requests in the exercise of his authority under the
                            Armistice Agreement;

Calls upon the Governments of Israel and
                            Syria to co-operate with the Chief of Staff to this end and to refrain
                            from any unilateral action which would prejudice it;

Affirms that nothing in this resolution
                            shall be deemed to supersede the Armistice Agreement or to change the
                            legal status of the demilitarized zone thereunder;
